cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use qiskit-omelyan, please cite the paper below as well as the software."
type: software
title: "qiskit-omelyan"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Omelyan-type (and related) symmetric product formulas for Hamiltonian time evolution in Qiskit.
  Provides a general ramp-based construction, OmelyanTrotter, a collection of optimized schemes from the
  literature, and a HighLevelSynthesis plugin for PauliEvolutionGate.
authors:
